+ - Nouveaux `probably.Axis.Schedule(spec: Axis.Spec, values: List[Value], least: Optional[Double] = Unset, most: Optional[Double] = Unset)`
+   et `probably.Runner#declare(id: Test.Id, kind: Entry.Kind, axis: Axis.Spec, least: Optional[Double], most: Optional[Double]): Unit`
+   (l'annonce, en mode listage, des bornes d'un axe émergent ; sans effet sinon). (#1966)
+ - `probably.TestEvent.TestScheduled(test: Ref, kind: Text, expected: Optional[Long])` devient

-   `TestScheduled(test: Ref, kind: Text, expected: Optional[Long], tags: List[Text], axes: List[TestEvent.AxisSchedule])`,
+   `TestScheduled(test: Ref, kind: Text, expected: Optional[Long], tags: List[Text], axes: List[TestEvent.AxisSchedule])`,

